# A new board the picker would make out of the workspace (`..` in its name) is refused, and
# the picker stays open (#422). tests/drive.rs checks nothing was written outside the
# workspace.
size 140x30
wait-for whiteboards · type to filter · ⏎ open · Esc back
type ../../Escaped
wait-for + new board "../../Escaped.canvas"
keys enter
wait-for ../../Escaped.canvas: a path can't have
expect whiteboards · type to filter · ⏎ open · Esc back
keys esc
exits 0
